The message suggest to have a look at the help page of scale_manual,
which tells you show to specify colours. shapes etc. manually.

for example:

ggplot(melt_seasonal, aes(x = date, y = value, group = ID)) +
 geom_point(aes(shape = factor(ID))) +

 facet_grid(variable ~ . , scales = "free") +

 scale_shape_manual("",values=c("106"= 1, "107"= 2, "100"= 3,
 "101"= 4, "125"= 5, "115"= 6, "110"= 7, "112"= 8, "124"= 9, "119"= 10))

