you have to map variables to aethetic, e.g:

 p<-ggplot(precipall, aes(Month, Rainfall))
 p + geom_bar(stat="identity", color="blue", fill="blue")+

 geom_point(data=precip2) +geom_line(data=precip2, aes(colour="precip2"))

