On Feb 19, 2:52 pm, "Kevin Jacobs <jac...@bioinformed.com>"
<bioinfor...@gmail.com> wrote:

> On Fri, Feb 19, 2010 at 8:56 AM, hadley wickham <h.wick...@gmail.com> wrote:
> > Hi Kevin,
>
